MangaReeda

This product is derived from RustMangaReader
(https://github.com/Lycoris52/RustMangaReader) by Lycoris52,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The RustMangaReader source files have been modified: ported to Linux,
reorganized into the src/app and src/engine modules, and renamed. Each
source file that contains code from RustMangaReader starts with a
comment saying so. The commit history of this repository records every
change made after the fork point (upstream commit 6def3e2).

Third-party files bundled in this repository (pdfium.dll, dav1d.dll and
the Noto Sans JP font) are listed with their licenses in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

"RustMangaReader" is the name of the original project. MangaReeda is
not endorsed by or affiliated with its author, nor with the author of
MangaMeeya.
